{"unit_id":"tag:03N2:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本章是关于概形（schemes）的平展上同调（<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology）的一系列章节中的第一章。本章讨论平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology），以及这一拓扑（topology）中阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的上同调（cohomology）的基础内容。初读时可以放心跳过所讨论的许多主题；如何决定跳过哪些内容，请参阅下一节的建议。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n本章的初始版本由 Johan de Jong 于 2009 年秋季在哥伦比亚大学讲授的平展上同调（<ACCENT_0003>tale cohomology）课程第一部分的讲义形成。最初的记录者是 Thibaut Pugin、Zachary Maddock 和 Min Lee。课程的第二部分可见关于迹公式（trace formula）的章节，参见迹公式（The Trace Formula）第 <REF_0001> 节。\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["Johan","de","Jong","Thibaut","Pugin","Zachary","Maddock","Min","Lee"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调"},{"source_term":"trace formula","target_term":"迹公式"},{"source_term":"The Trace Formula","target_term":"迹公式"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"研究对象，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调","context":"本章和课程主题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"修饰拓扑，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"上同调所在的拓扑，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"上同调的对象，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"本章讨论的理论，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"trace formula","target_term":"迹公式","context":"后续章节主题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"The Trace Formula","target_term":"迹公式","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
