{"unit_id":"tag:04JG:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们希望用本章的材料发展与代数空间（algebraic spaces）、Deligne-Mumford 栈（Deligne-Mumford stacks）、代数栈（algebraic stacks）等相关的理论。因此，我们在原先关于概形（schemes）的平展上同调（<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology）的论述中加入了一些相当技术性的材料。读者可以通过“拓扑斯（topos）”一词出现的频率、与集合论（set theory）相关的讨论，或处理概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）的非常一般的性质的证明，来辨认这些材料。初读时可以跳过其中一些讨论。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n具体来说，我们建议读者跳过以下各节：\n<STRUCT_0004>\n<STRUCT_0005> 比较大（big）与小（small）的拓扑斯（topoi），第 <REF_0001> 节。\n<STRUCT_0006> 恢复态射（morphisms），第 <REF_0002> 节。\n<STRUCT_0007> 推送（Push）与拉回（pull），第 <REF_0003> 节。\n<STRUCT_0008> 性质（Property）（A），第 <REF_0004> 节。\n<STRUCT_0009> 性质（Property）（B），第 <REF_0005> 节。\n<STRUCT_0010> 性质（Property）（C），第 <REF_0006> 节。\n<STRUCT_0011> 小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）位点（site）的拓扑不变性（Topological invariance），第 <REF_0007> 节。\n<STRUCT_0012> 整（Integral）的普遍单射（injective）态射（morphisms），第 <REF_0008> 节。\n<STRUCT_0013> 大（Big）位点（sites）与推前（pushforward），第 <REF_0009> 节。\n<STRUCT_0014> 大（big）下惊叹号（lower shriek）的正合性（Exactness），第 <REF_0010> 节。\n<STRUCT_0015>\n除这些节以外，还有一些零散的结果可以跳过，读者可以根据上述关键词辨认这些结果。\n\n\n\n<COMMENT_0001>","allowed_english":["Deligne-Mumford","A","B","C"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Deligne-Mumford stacks","target_term":"Deligne-Mumford 栈"},{"source_term":"algebraic stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"set theory","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Push","target_term":"推送"},{"source_term":"pull","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"Property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"Property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"Property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Topological invariance","target_term":"拓扑不变性"},{"source_term":"Integral","target_term":"整"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"普遍单射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推前"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"lower shriek","target_term":"下惊叹号"},{"source_term":"Exactness","target_term":"正合性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"相关理论，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Deligne-Mumford stacks","target_term":"Deligne-Mumford 栈","context":"相关理论，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"algebraic stacks","target_term":"代数栈","context":"相关理论，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"上同调和态射的对象，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调","context":"原先论述的主题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"技术性材料的关键词，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"set theory","target_term":"集合论","context":"技术性讨论，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"一般性质和章节主题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"拓扑斯及下惊叹号语境，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"拓扑斯和位点语境，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"比较对象，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Push","target_term":"推送","context":"章节标题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"pull","target_term":"拉回","context":"章节标题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Property","target_term":"性质","context":"性质 A、B、C，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"修饰位点，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"小平展位点，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Topological invariance","target_term":"拓扑不变性","context":"章节主题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Integral","target_term":"整","context":"态射的性质，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"普遍单射","context":"原文 universally 限定 injective，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Big","target_term":"大","context":"修饰位点，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"章节主题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推前","context":"相关运算，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"lower shriek","target_term":"下惊叹号","context":"相关运算，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Exactness","target_term":"正合性","context":"相关性质，暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
